{"game": "lort", "language": "english", "appid": 2956680, "month": "2026-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1788825600, "end_date": 1789516799, "month_true_total": 61, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 15:04:50 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "235287336", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028550568", "personaname": "BlopMe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ofekgur/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 740, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 708, "last_played": 1789417888, "avatar": "0de372c6dd192a01f8a21e8ab0eb21a28d228e67"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just a great casual game", "timestamp_created": 1789415901, "timestamp_updated": 1789415901, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235252556", "author": {"steamid": "76561199540020901", "personaname": "Rhinneczte", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Rhinneczte/", "num_games_owned": 857, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 74, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 74, "last_played": 1769898095, "avatar": "66662b50080a9abb23d1a64aeeccfed6188a9ea2"}, "language": "english", "review": "I feel like a lot of the people looking to get this game are chasing the same experience that Risk of Rain 2 provides; or, at least, thats what got me to try this game. To be very blunt, there's no real reason to play this over any other roguelite. The combat feels sluggish, with attack animations that dont have any weight behind them. The maps are very bland and empty. The items aren't particularly fun or interesting, and its hard to get a good build going because youre on a not-so-generous timer that gives you very little time to actively farm gold to buy items. The only somewhat interesting idea that this game has is the weapon system, but even that just isnt nearly enough to make the game fun.\n\nTLDR, this game is subpar at everything it tries to do; if you want to play a game like this, just stick with Risk of Rain.", "timestamp_created": 1789377723, "timestamp_updated": 1789377723, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47826087474822998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "hardware": {"system_ram": "81844", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 5600XT 6-Core Processor            ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti", "vram_size": 8024}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235132133", "author": {"steamid": "76561198101552619", "personaname": "horimoto3493", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198101552619/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1020, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 42, "playtime_at_review": 341, "last_played": 1790214241, "avatar": "9a0d27c0b17513dca194b9916aea4f9b55ea825b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Buddy and i gave this game a try when we were looking for something new to play. The game seemed fun at first, next thing we know, its almost 6 hours later and we did 3 complete runs through. definitely had a blast playing and we plan on getting more ppl to play with us. lobby sizes of 8 on games like this is unheard of and i for one am excited to give the chaos of it a try", "timestamp_created": 1789246105, "timestamp_updated": 1789246105, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primaril